  "body": "For many (but not all) method/getter/setter definitions, update to use:\n\n* The defined term \"this\", instead of \"this X object\" or \"the X object\"\n* The \"method steps\"/\"getter steps\"/\"setter steps\" introductory clauses\n* Separate method steps for overloads, calling into a shared algorithm\n\n---\n\nI had the ambition of removing all \"this X object\" uses, but some are more complicated and I gave up about 2/3 of the way through, realizing I'd spent too much time on this already. Still, a nice step in the right direction. Searching for `this[\\s\\n]+<code>[^<]+</code>(?![\\s\\n]+element)` now gives 64 matches, mostly OffscreenCanvas, CustomElementRegistry, and ElementInternals.\n\nMost changes here are mechanical but the canvas methods I updated probably need a bit closer review than the rest.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/common-dom-interfaces.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/dynamic-markup-insertion.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/form-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/history.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/imagebitmap-and-animations.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/imagebitmap-and-animations.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/imagebitmap-and-animations.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/media.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">/media.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7294/4a2bc22...33f0f4a/media.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2021, 8:53 AM UTC (33f0f4a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org